flowchart TD
  S([Read student standing]) --> SCH{Fee schedule<br/>configured?}
  SCH -->|No| CL[Cleared]
  SCH -->|Yes| REQ[required_so_far = sum of installments due on/before today]
  REQ --> PAID[validated_paid = sum of validated payments]
  PAID --> SF{shortfall =<br/>required - paid > 0?}
  SF -->|No| CL
  SF -->|Yes| DEF{Active approved<br/>deferral?}
  DEF -->|Yes| DF[Deferred — gate lifted until new deadline]
  DEF -->|No| BL[Blocked — no exam / facility access]
